{"id":"ef985ef690eaa6d0","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-greedycover.md","title":"Greedy covering runs and outputs","display":"df-greedycover — Greedy covering runs and outputs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-greedycover","aliases":["27-df-greedycover"],"display":"df-greedycover — Greedy covering runs and outputs","depends_on":["[[27-df-covermatrix]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§3.3.4","source_printed_pages":"156,157","source_pdf_pages":"180,181","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-greedycover"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-greedycover</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-greedycover — Greedy covering runs and outputs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1dd9f6247717bebe\" href=\"?note=1dd9f6247717bebe\" title=\"27-df-covermatrix\">27-df-covermatrix</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"156,157"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"180,181"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,C\">\\(R,C\\)</span> 为非空有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle\">\\(A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall r\\in R\\;\\exists j\\in C\\;A(r,j)=1\">\\(\\forall r\\in R\\;\\exists j\\in C\\;A(r,j)=1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le q\\le\\min\\{|R|,|C|\\}\">\\(1\\le q\\le\\min\\{|R|,|C|\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf j=(j_1,\\ldots,j_q)\\in C^q\">\\(\\mathbf j=(j_1,\\ldots,j_q)\\in C^q\\)</span>；不预设各项互异。矩阵编码、求值与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cov}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cov}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1dd9f6247717bebe\" href=\"?note=1dd9f6247717bebe\" title=\"27-df-covermatrix\">27-df-covermatrix</a>。未覆盖集、运行谓词与输出覆盖族由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t)\\coloneqq\\{r\\in R\\mid\\forall s\\in[t]\\;A(r,j_s)=0\\}\\quad(t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,q\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t)\\coloneqq\\{r\\in R\\mid\\forall s\\in[t]\\;A(r,j_s)=0\\}\\quad(t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,q\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GreedyRun}(A,\\mathbf j)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left((\\forall s,t\\in[q]\\;(s&lt;t\\Rightarrow j_s\\ne j_t))\\land U_{A,\\mathbf j}(q)=\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall t\\in[q]\\;\\left(U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t-1)\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall j\\in C\\setminus\\{j_1,\\ldots,j_{t-1}\\}\\;\\sum_{r\\in U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t-1)}A(r,j_t)\\ge\\sum_{r\\in U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t-1)}A(r,j)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GreedyRun}(A,\\mathbf j)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left((\\forall s,t\\in[q]\\;(s&lt;t\\Rightarrow j_s\\ne j_t))\\land U_{A,\\mathbf j}(q)=\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall t\\in[q]\\;\\left(U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t-1)\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall j\\in C\\setminus\\{j_1,\\ldots,j_{t-1}\\}\\;\\sum_{r\\in U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t-1)}A(r,j_t)\\ge\\sum_{r\\in U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t-1)}A(r,j)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GreedyCover}(A)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq C\\mid\\exists q\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\min\\{|R|,|C|\\}\\}\\;\\exists\\mathbf j\\in C^q\\;(S=\\{j_t\\mid t\\in[q]\\}\\land\\mathrm{GreedyRun}(A,\\mathbf j))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GreedyCover}(A)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq C\\mid\\exists q\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\min\\{|R|,|C|\\}\\}\\;\\exists\\mathbf j\\in C^q\\;(S=\\{j_t\\mid t\\in[q]\\}\\land\\mathrm{GreedyRun}(A,\\mathbf j))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathrm{GreedyCover}(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cov}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varnothing\\ne\\mathrm{GreedyCover}(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cov}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每一步选覆盖当前未覆盖行最多的未选列。无零行保证尚有未覆盖行时可选到至少覆盖一行的列，所以至多 min{|R|,|C|} 步终止。谓词对量化的所有候选序列都有真假值：重复序列被互异条件拒绝，未覆盖集显式以矩阵及序列作参数。以全称比较表达全部并列最大值，不需要在重复序列上求可能为空的 argmax。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-covermatrix","status":"resolved","id":"1dd9f6247717bebe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-covermatrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-covermatrix","status":"resolved","id":"1dd9f6247717bebe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R,C$ 为非空有限集，$a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle$，且 $\\forall r\\in R\\;\\exists j\\in C\\;A(r,j)=1$。$q\\in\\mathbb N$，$1\\le q\\le\\min\\{|R|,|C|\\}$，$\\mathbf j=(j_1,\\ldots,j_q)\\in C^q$；不预设各项互异。矩阵编码、求值与 $\\mathrm{Cov}$ 见 [[27-df-covermatrix]]。未覆盖集、运行谓词与输出覆盖族由下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R,C","display":false},{"tex":"a:R\\times C\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\langle R,C,a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall r\\in R\\;\\exists j\\in C\\;A(r,j)=1","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"1\\le q\\le\\min\\{|R|,|C|\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf j=(j_1,\\ldots,j_q)\\in C^q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cov}","display":false},{"tex":"U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t)\\coloneqq\\{r\\in R\\mid\\forall s\\in[t]\\;A(r,j_s)=0\\}\\quad(t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,q\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GreedyRun}(A,\\mathbf j)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left((\\forall s,t\\in[q]\\;(s<t\\Rightarrow j_s\\ne j_t))\\land U_{A,\\mathbf j}(q)=\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall t\\in[q]\\;\\left(U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t-1)\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall j\\in C\\setminus\\{j_1,\\ldots,j_{t-1}\\}\\;\\sum_{r\\in U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t-1)}A(r,j_t)\\ge\\sum_{r\\in U_{A,\\mathbf j}(t-1)}A(r,j)\\right)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GreedyCover}(A)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq C\\mid\\exists q\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\min\\{|R|,|C|\\}\\}\\;\\exists\\mathbf j\\in C^q\\;(S=\\{j_t\\mid t\\in[q]\\}\\land\\mathrm{GreedyRun}(A,\\mathbf j))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathrm{GreedyCover}(A)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cov}(A).","display":true}],"bytes":2377,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-greedycover|df-greedycover — Greedy covering runs and outputs]]"},{"id":"0260751b03daa79e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R,C,A$ 满足 [[27-df-greedycover]] 的假设，$S\\in\\mathrm{GreedyCover}(A)$，$\\mathrm{Cov}$ 见 [[27-df-covermatrix]]。$d=\\max_{j\\in C}|\\{r\\in R\\mid A(r,j)=1\\}|\\ge1$，$m=\\min_{Q\\in\\mathrm{Cov}(A)}|Q|$。"}],"outgoing":["1dd9f6247717bebe"]}